{"id":1140203,"chapter_id":1140203,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"男人","content":"露莉艾卡？露莉艾卡？","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"少女","content":"嗯……？","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"少女","content":"怎么了？爸爸？人家还没睡够——","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"男人","content":"嘘……小点声。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"男人","content":"能和爸爸做一个游戏么？","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"少女","content":"好诶！","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"男人","content":"小点声！","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"少女","content":"耶！露莉最喜欢玩游戏了。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"男人","content":"规则很简单，从现在开始，你要躲在这里，不能说一句话，不能发出一点声响，直到晚上八点整才能出来。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"少女","content":"啊……那这也太难了吧，爸爸！","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"男人","content":"奖品是这把你一直想要的左轮手枪，和你那把不一样哦。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"少女","content":"哇！……那，那露莉要玩！露莉一定不会输的！","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"男人","content":"从现在开始，发生什么都别出声，知道了么！","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"男人","content":"要是耍小聪明的话，你这辈子都别想要你的左轮手枪了。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"少女","content":"嗯！","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"男人","content":"那爸爸走了？你可一定要藏好！爸爸相信，幸运的你一定会赢过爸爸的。","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"少女","content":"嗯！","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"随着柜子被关上，室外开始响起了枪声。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"枪声一直响，一直响，少女几次想要推开柜子的门，但想起约定的内容，却只能将手抽回。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"无论是呻吟声，不认识的人的声音，奸笑声……不管房间里发生了什么，她都没打开衣柜的门。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"少女真的很听话，毕竟这可是赌上了她最想要的东西。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"晚上八点到了，少女在衣柜中反复呼叫着父亲的名字，想让他来给自己开门。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"但却没有一个人过来为她的胜利庆贺。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"像往常的话，如果她打赌赢了父亲，波普姨妈就会最先拿着她最喜欢的棒棒糖分给她，来庆贺这场胜利。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"少女","content":"爸爸？爸爸？","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"少女","content":"这次是露莉赢了哦！露莉要来拿自己的奖品，你可不能赖账——","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"少女推了推门，但却发现门好像被什么东西所堵住，没办法推开。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"为了拿到自己的奖品，少女用尽全力将门打开。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"打开的一瞬间，她惊呆了。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"父亲冰冷的身体倒在她的身上。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"他用千疮百孔的身体，死死地护住露莉艾卡。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"少女的视线越过父亲的肩头，看向这衣柜之外。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"一个又一个四叶草帮的人，都倒在自己的面前。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"她颤抖着，将手伸向父亲的脸颊，希望他还能再和自己说说话。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"但已经不可能了，男人早已没了呼吸。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"他的手中，还死死攥着那把承诺给少女的左轮手枪。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"少女","content":"爸……爸……","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"少女","content":"大……家……","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"少女的声音渐渐远去，模糊……","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"你好像做了一个梦，一个关于少女和父亲的梦。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"睁开眼睛。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"你发现自己躺在管理局的床上，身边还站着夜莺。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，感觉如何？这是你在管理局疗养室度过的第五天，预计还有四天才能重返工作岗位。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"options":["没什么问题","已经习惯了"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203044,"trial_step":44,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"没什么问题","goto":45},{"text":"已经习惯了","goto":null}]},{"step":45,"content":"距离上次行动负伤，已经过去了五天时间。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"你动了动自己的右臂，仍有阵阵刺痛。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"希望您不要勉强自己。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"若非禁闭者露莉艾卡及时将毒气的解药提供给您，可能您的疗养时长会再增加一个月。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"options":["是她给了我解药？"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203049,"trial_step":49,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"是她给了我解药？","goto":50}]},{"step":50,"content":"她是怎么做到的？明明她当时受了那么严重的伤。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"根据现场的调查结果来看，是您在救了她之后，下意识发动了枷锁。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"再一次激发了禁闭者露莉艾卡的能力，才能让她有机会拿到帮派手里的解药。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"options":["现场还有生还者么？"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203053,"trial_step":53,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"现场还有生还者么？","goto":54}]},{"step":54,"content":"你想起了当时的任务目标，要保全线人的性命。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"还有一个，可惜他似乎并不知道更多关于狂厄武器交易的信息了。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"让你惊讶的是，露莉艾卡并没有对向她投掷毒气弹的人下杀手。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"content":"于是你让夜莺还是照常送些文件进来。要是现在不看，再回到办公室……就会看到堆积如山的档案文件。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"夜莺点了点头，离开了你的房间。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"今天送来的文件不算多，只有两三个卷宗。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"你只用了一个小时，便完成了翻阅和批注，并且给夜莺留言，让她稍晚时间来取走这部分文件。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"完成工作后，你抬头看了看时间。刚好10点，是你和她约定好的时间。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"今天这位禁闭者看来并没有那么守时。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"可能是遇到什么麻烦了吧，毕竟那么能闯祸，就算被夜莺关了禁闭也不奇怪。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"你单手伸了个懒腰，走到窗边，拉开窗帘，正要享受早上的阳光时——","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"一张紧紧贴在窗户上的大脸进入了你的视野。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"早上好……局长……","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"在这一瞬间，你的内心深处萌生出了想把这个熊孩子一脚踢下去的冲动。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"但你还是打开窗，放她进了屋子。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"局长可以帮露莉削苹果嘛！露莉现在满手都是绷带，好不方便。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"content":"露莉艾卡根本就没把这里当成病房。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"说着每天都来探望你，结果还是你这个病号在忙前忙后。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"options":["今天怎么来这么晚？"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203072,"trial_step":72,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"今天怎么来这么晚？","goto":73}]},{"step":73,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"嗯……本来早就想来的，但露莉之前有点事要处理。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"什么事？你不会又闯祸了吧？","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"局长不要总是对露莉有偏见！","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"露莉艾卡鼓起了脸颊。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"露莉上次可是有及时收手的！","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"虽然你想继续对露莉艾卡说教，但至少那次……露莉艾卡也算是救了你的命。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"那这次可要算你输了。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"姆——！局长真讨厌！总是在用这些奇怪的规则来要求露莉！","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"而且露莉总感觉……一在局长身边，运气就变得没那么好了。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"options":["比如刚才？"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203082,"trial_step":82,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"比如刚才？","goto":83}]},{"step":83,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"啊啊……不许再说了！听不见听不见听不见！","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"嘘——这里要肃静。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"好……","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"那……要不然，今天就算露莉输了吧，是露莉没有履行约定10点到！","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"content":"那今天就要轮到我提问了。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哼，来吧，露莉才不怕你呢。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"content":"以前你也是和这样家人玩游戏的么？","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"……","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"是。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"content":"打赌输了的露莉艾卡像个听话的乖孩子，安静地坐在你的床沿上。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"尤其是爸爸，他会放下手边的一切来陪露莉玩游戏，来哄露莉开心。让露莉觉得自己，是那个最幸运的小孩。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"content":"所以你从小就很幸运？","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"content":"你听着露莉的诉说，手上也没闲着，苹果很快就被你削好了皮。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"options":["吃么？"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203096,"trial_step":96,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"吃么？","goto":97}]},{"step":97,"content":"露莉艾卡一把拿过苹果，咬了一大口。一边吃一边继续诉说着以前的经历。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"当然不是了，笨蛋局长。那些“幸运”都来自于……爸爸，还有四叶草的大家。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"爸爸是四叶草的首领。在露莉刚出生不久，妈妈就去世了，帮派里的大家照顾露莉长大，他们都是露莉的家人。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"他们真的很宠露莉。不论露莉提什么要求，他们都会想办法满足。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"有一次，露莉发现自己弄丢了最喜欢的小熊玩偶。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"露莉那时候特别伤心，因为那可是杰克叔叔送的生日礼物。但杰克叔叔想方设法找到了它。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"content":"就是你带在身边的这个？","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"是啊。杰克叔叔告诉露莉：“这只小熊就是你的幸运物，是你的四叶草，你的幸运马蹄铁。”","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"只要有它在，露莉就是世界上最幸运的小孩。无论多么凶险的状况，都能平安度过。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"那时候，关于露莉艾卡的幸运是个谎言，一个由那些最爱露莉艾卡的人编造的……温柔的、善意的谎言。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"content":"他们是怎么做到的？","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"此外，还有另一份文件，或许您会感兴趣。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"甚至逛商店的时候没带钱，都能遇上“出来买东西”的波普姨妈。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"刚开始的时候，露莉以为自己真的很幸运。但长大一些后，露莉就知道了幸运的真相。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"不过理查德哥哥给我带的糖果真的很好吃，现在我还能记得它们的味道！","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"content":"相比管理局的伙食呢？","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"嗯……管理局的饭是很好吃啦。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"但是露莉还是怀念之前，和家人们一起热热闹闹吃饭的日子。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"content":"阳光落在露莉艾卡的背上，为她平添了一丝阴霾。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"好可惜啊……露莉再也没机会了。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"要是露莉当初再勇敢一点的话……会不会，有更好的结局呢……","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"content":"家人过世的伤心往事如同泥沼般再次困住了露莉艾卡，这次你打算拉她一把。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"options":["敲她的头","捏她的脸颊"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203119,"trial_step":119,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"敲她的头","goto":120},{"text":"捏她的脸颊","goto":null}]},{"step":120,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"好痛！局长，你突然对露莉干什么呢！","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"content":"我们再打一个赌吧。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"content":"就赌你不会再一个人，漫无目的地复仇了。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"嘿嘿……局长，你马上就会输的哦。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"content":"因为以后你要跟我一起去惩罚那些帮派。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"content":"不过，我和你的家人们不一样，我可不会宠着你。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"content":"要是你偷偷去复仇，被我抓回来的话……","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"会怎么样？","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"options":["会狠狠地弹你的额头","会把你关进禁闭室"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203128,"trial_step":128,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"会狠狠地弹你的额头","goto":129},{"text":"会把你关进禁闭室","goto":null}]},{"step":129,"content":"听懂了么？上次你说我不认真，这次我可是很认真的！","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哈哈，还真是有局长的风格呢。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203130,"trial_step":130},{"step":131,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"露莉答应你了。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，局长？","style":11,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"有紧急情况。","style":11,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"content":"说吧，我在听。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"content":"就在你和露莉艾卡完成约定后，夜莺的紧急通讯接踵而至。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"禁闭者露莉艾卡又一次逃脱了禁闭，我们通过她的行踪推测，她大概在你的病房附近。","style":11,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"content":"原来你今天不走正门是因为这件事么？","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203137,"trial_step":137},{"step":138,"content":"你望向想要偷偷拉开窗户的露莉艾卡。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203138,"trial_step":138},{"step":139,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"哈……哈哈……情况特殊。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203139,"trial_step":139},{"step":140,"speaker":"露莉艾卡","content":"那……再见啦，局长，要记得我们的约定哦！","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203140,"trial_step":140},{"step":141,"content":"露莉艾卡一把拉开窗户，纵身跃下。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203141,"trial_step":141},{"step":142,"content":"露——莉——艾——卡——！","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":240203142,"trial_step":142}]}